Any source elaboration corrections need a preserved diff and semantic review. The separate run must produce fresh successful receipts for both new sources, its aggregate and the complete 219-module ownership audit, with exact prerequisite identities and ordinary axiom restrictions. The already accepted 1,568-module graph and evidence remain frozen. No enlarged union, new observation capability or general G4 forcing theorem is inferred by this adapter review.
